# ffi/logs/rust/stage3-M2-M4-revalidated.log
# W3: M2 and M4 re-measured after the schema change at 0c2d4d7f, which made the Output
# adapter's three states reachable. Per D11 and per the aggregating session's request:
# the slice re-runs rather than the aggregating session deciding from a distance that
# the ratios will not have moved.
# 2026-09-18
#
# CONFIGURATION (R7): as ffi/logs/rust/stage3-M2.log. rustc 1.94.1 release, prost 0.14.4,
# cdylib boundary, guard on, ascii, 4 shared vCPUs in a container. MSRV 1.88 declared,
# not verified.
#
# WHAT CHANGED IN THE PAYLOADS: P2.1 to P2.4 and P4.1 shrank, because the adapter no
# longer writes an error string on every element. P2.5 did not move (half_absent already
# removed the nested site). Sizes are in the stage 1 log of the same date.

